.NH 2
Alternative Designs

.NH 3
Alternative 1
.PP
One possible alternative would be to place contract handling inside Proposal Management.
This would reduce the total number of contexts and remove some communication between contexts.
The disadvantage is that the resulting context would have lower cohesion.
Managing project proposals mainly concerns project information and approval, whereas contracts and payments concern legal agreements, signatures, restricted information, and financial administration.
The contract also has stricter access requirements because it should only be available to the relevant participants and staff.
For this reason, I would keep **Contract & Payment** separate.
Although this creates an additional dependency, each context has a clearer responsibility and the sensitive contract information can be handled independently.

